Are you really going to let a fine 
property like this get away, ma'am?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:07:01.440
Prime Real Estate
Listing Documents

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:01.780
Okay, first I've got to hit it off 
with this lord, no matter what.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.800
Fearlessly go forth! 
Go and you shall know!

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.400
After securing support,

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.990
Yamano Mitsuha will set off 
for the royal capital!

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:12.010
Hm?

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:13.660
Sniff, sniff.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.610
It stinks!

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:19.790
I stink!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.750
<i>I haven't been able to take a bath...</i>

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:26.210
<i>I guess I'll return to Earth for now.</i>

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.490
Excuse me!

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:31.100
Could you let me off here?

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.210
What? In a place like this?!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.220
I just suddenly remembered

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.900
that the friends from my country

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:40.360
said they'd come look for me 
on the other side of that tree!

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.060
What?!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.680
If I'm not there like I promised, 
they'll all be worried.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:48.750
But walking there will 
take you quite some time.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:51.240
It's fine! I can walk quite a bit!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:54.530
Well, if you insist...

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:04.640
Shh...

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.990
Well then, time to try it out!

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:11.180
Jump to my house on Earth!

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.200
There.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:17.470
It's my room...

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.990
Yes! I successfully jumped worlds!

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:22.330
All right!

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:27.920
I feel alive again!

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:37.060
Okay, commence operation!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.180
Oh, Mitsuha-chan. Off to work?

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:44.450
Yes, that's right.

