00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:43.980
Hi.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.790
I'm Mitsuha Yamano.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.180
Nice to meet you.

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:48.960
Nice to meet you, too.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.340
Where are you from?

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:53.400
New Zealand.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.370
Wow! Nice!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.960
Okay, let's see if the language 
mastery worked.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.120
Oh, I can read it! I can read it!

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:06.230
<i>Let's check this, this, and this one!</i>

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:10.560
<i>Private Military and Security Company.</i>

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:14.620
<i>Combat against threats, 
guarding dignitaries,</i>

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:17.840
<i>security and logistics 
for facilities and trains.</i>

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:22.350
<i>It is a company that provides services 
such as military education for civilians.</i>

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.200
I understand! I understand it!

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.450
What a cheat skill!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:29.100
But this one's a bit too large-scale...

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:33.820
This one seems pretty good.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:37.780
<i>Call us and we'll be right there, 
even at the ends of the Earth!</i>

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:39.830
Wolf's Fang, huh?

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:43.360
Okay, let's go with this.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:57.340
I can jump to a destination 
if I have a clear image of it,

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:00.600
but I can't picture places 
I haven't been to, so it won't work...

00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:02.680
I know!

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:07.390
I call it Operation Satellite!

