Hey, you, state your business.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.280
I'd like to speak with 
the person in charge here.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.480
Hello there, young lady.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:57.880
Am I right to assume you're here as a client?

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:58.920
Yes.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.540
A pleasure to meet you.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.910
My name is Mitsuha.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.900
I'd like to request your services.

