from some faraway country?

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:27.610
<i>Now I'm on my way to securing 
a means of self-defense.</i>

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:32.600
<i>I don't know how lawless it is 
in the other world, so it's a must.</i>

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:36.900
<i>Ah, I'm beat. Good night...</i>

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.720
A concealed carry pistol for self-defense,

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.360
a machine pistol as your main weapon,

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.660
and a revolver as backup, huh?

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:50.890
In addition, training on all manner 
of automatic rifles and small arms.

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:54.790
Is that little girl looking to wage war 
on an organized group or what?

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:58.500
Well, as long as we get paid, 
I won't sweat the small stuff...

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.690
But appraise this, she says.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.240
Where's this currency from?

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:04.880
Well, then.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:09.140
From what I can tell, that world 
was a lot like medieval Europe.

